   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The real hypothetical period in context",
     "texto": [
      "In daily life decisions depend on setbacks: traffic, the weather or train timetables. **Se + present** sets up the hypothesis and the result goes in the **present** or **simple future**: **Se piove, resteremo a casa** (if it rains, we'll stay at home); **Se parti adesso, arrivi in orario** (if you leave now, you'll arrive on time)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Connectors of cause and smooth consequence",
     "texto": [
      "To articulate the account, these are combined: **quindi** (so / therefore), **perché** (because / why), **perciò** (that's why) and **dopo** (after): **Anna ha perso il treno, quindi aspetta il prossimo** (Anna has missed the train, so she waits for the next one)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
